{"abstract":"In accordance with the Paperwork Reduction Act of 1995, this notice invites the general public and other public agencies to comment on this proposed information collection. This collection is a revision of a currently approved collection; the purpose of this information collection request is to continue the use of the electronic form FNA- 775. This form will continue to provide for the collection of Personal Identifiable Information required to conduct background investigation which is a pre-requisite for all non-FNA employees (contractor, intern, volunteers, etc.) to be granted a security clearance for employment at all FNA locations.","action":"Notice.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE","name":"Agriculture Department","id":12,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/agriculture-department","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/12","parent_id":null,"slug":"agriculture-department"},{"raw_name":"Food and Nutrition Administration","name":"Food and Nutrition Administration","id":625,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/food-and-nutrition-administration","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/625","parent_id":12,"slug":"food-and-nutrition-administration"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2026/06/15/2026-11917.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"91 FR 35951","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":"2026-08-14","correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Written comments must be received on or before August 14, 2026.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":[],"dockets":[{"supporting_documents":[],"agency_name":"FNA","documents":[{"comment_count":2,"comment_start_date":"2026-06-15","updated_at":"2026-08-15T01:56:44.872-04:00","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/FNA-2026-0071-0001","allow_late_comments":false,"id":"FNA-2026-0071-0001","comment_end_date":"2026-08-15","regulations_dot_gov_open_for_comment":false}],"supportin